  "description": "Yeon-geon Baek has harbored a crush on his best friend, Eihwa Yoon, for years, but he’s finally had enough rejection. Determined to get away, he starts planning his leave to study abroad. He’s spent too many years hiding behind castle walls built of secrets. However, the more he tries to distance himself, the more his secrets are pulled out into the open.\nMaybe when it’s over, things will be better, and maybe… he’ll be able to have what he’s always wanted. \n\n(Source: Tapas)",
